    87	/**
    88	 * This class maintains the tree data structure. It doesn't have any networking
    89	 * or client connection code in it so that it can be tested in a standalone way.
    90	 *
    91	 * <p>The tree maintains two parallel data structures: a hashtable that maps from
    92	 * full paths to DataNodes and a tree of DataNodes. All accesses to a path is
    93	 * through the hashtable. The tree is traversed only when serializing to disk.
